# Vela

Course platform learning project. Brand is **Vela** in English and Arabic. Never translate or replace the name (not منارة, not a localized wordmark). `brandName` is `"Vela"` in both locale files.

## Workflow

- One roadmap phase per request ([docs/roadmap.md](docs/roadmap.md)). Stop when that phase is done.
- No automated tests.
- After an important phase: a short note in `docs/` and comments only on non-obvious code.

## Git

- `master` is the integrated app (last finished phase).
- For each phase: branch `feat/phase-0N-<slug>` from current `master` (not from the previous phase branch once that phase is on `master`).
- Commit on the phase branch (small commits by concern, same as Phase 1). Merge into `master` when the phase is done.
- Do not `git push` unless asked.

## Architecture

- `src/app` — routes, layouts, and that segment’s `loading.tsx` / `error.tsx` / `not-found.tsx` only.
- `src/modules/<feature>/index.tsx` — feature UI.
- `src/components` — shared UI. Radix primitives for complex widgets; semantic HTML + Tailwind otherwise. Not shadcn, not Radix Themes.
- `src/api` — only UI-facing data layer. `src/data` is a temporary in-memory/JSON store.
- `src/content` — UI strings. Course records stay in `src/data` (bilingual fields).
- `src/paths.ts` — locale-unprefixed path helpers. Use next-intl `Link`.

## Rendering and UX

- Server Components by default. Client components only for language switcher, mobile nav, forms, video player, and similar interactivity.
- When a route, fetch, or mutation can pend or fail, ship `loading.tsx` / `error.tsx` / `not-found.tsx`, pending submit, and empty states in the **same phase**. Do not defer them to polish.
- `lang` and `dir` on `<html>`. Tailwind logical properties (`ps`/`pe`, `ms`/`me`, `start`/`end`).

## Next.js 16

Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before writing Next.js code. Prefer `proxy.ts` over deprecated `middleware.ts`. `params`, `searchParams`, `cookies()`, and `headers()` are async.

## Do not

- Collect card PANs on our origin (demo checkout only).
- Add Redux, React Query, shadcn, a CMS, or a mock REST server for demonstration.
- Edit the Next.js-managed block in `AGENTS.md`.
